<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-TIGER WOODS TO PLAY IN AUSTRALIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-TIGER WOODS TO PLAY IN AUSTRALIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tiger Woods has signed up to play</p>
<p>in the Australian Open next month in what will be his first</p>
<p>overseas tournament as a professional.</p>
<p>The 20-year-old American, who joined the pro circuit a month</p>
<p>ago after winning three U.S. amateur titles, will be joining a</p>
<p>field that includes Australia's world number one Greg Norman,</p>
<p>organisers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Australian Open will be held in Sydney from November</p>
<p>21-24 with prize money of A$1 million ($800,000).</p>
</text>
